  * Added `app.match.VERB()`, ex `app.match.put('/user/12')`. Closes #606
  * Added `app.VERB(path)` as alias of `app.lookup.VERB()`.
  * Dependency `connect >= 1.2.0`

2.1.1 / 2011-03-29
==================

