  lib-type-of x 8,838,283 ops/sec ±1.02% (87 runs sampled)
  lib-typeof x 8,677,848 ops/sec ±0.87% (87 runs sampled)

  fastest is kind-of (by 196% avg)

# boolean (24 bytes)
