### Bug Fixes

* install semantic-release as a regular dev dependency ([#3455](https://github.com/karma-runner/karma/issues/3455)) ([1eaf35e](https://github.com/karma-runner/karma/commit/1eaf35e1d616a2ef21dd00d843552f189fbc7c94))
