### v0.11.3 (2013-11-20)


#### Bug Fixes

* **config:** not append empty module if no custom launcher/rep/prep ([ee15a4e4](https://github.com/karma-runner/karma/commit/ee15a4e446e9f35949a2fdde7cbdbecdd7ca0750))
