    └── ResourceManagementServices.kt (added)
```

## 🎬 Act III: Documentation Phase (Commits 7218f4b3 → 089020d3)
**"Implementation summaries and alignment docs"**

Pyramid apex - distilled wisdom:
```
~8 key files - Documentation crystallization
├── Architecture Docs
│   ├── IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md
│   ├── TRIKESHED_ALIGNMENT.md
│   └── README.md (updated)
├── Executable Demos
