```

## 🎬 Act IV: Museum Preservation (Recent commits)
**"Architectural artistry preservation"**

Final pyramid point - essential essence:
```
~5 essential files - Museum curation
├── Documentation Consolidation
│   ├── DOCS_FINAL.md
│   ├── DOCS_SUMMARY.md
│   └── DOCS_REUP.md
├── Core Implementation
